# ILLUSTRATIVE topo file for the pcsf_conversion_demo -- 47
# synthetic UTM-zone-48N points along a straight illustrative
# transect (25 m station spacing), NOT a real GPS survey of
# data/occam2D's Tongkeng CSAMT stations. Demonstrates the
# positional (.bln, count-matched) branch of
# pycsamt.format.topo_source: no station identity in this
# format, so all 47 points are attributed in survey order.
